                <pb facs="0614" n="502" xml:id="pg502"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Fox to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-08-30"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 30,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Department’s August 10. Brazilian minister and I will make representations
                    simultaneously at 3 p.m. to-day by means of individual notes in Portuguese and
                    in English adhering to the department text.</p>
                <p>Have advised Lima.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
